          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5.6.1 Which of the two unequal chords is farther from the centre?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.686,
            0.884,
            0.727
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You have two chords on a circle. One is longer than the other. Which chord is closer to the centre? Can you guess?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
